Where it was built
------------------
The booster was developed inside a fork of Grok UI
(https://github.com/joeynyc/Grok-UI), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Grok UI contributors.

No Grok UI source is included. Checked when this notice was written: every
module the command line and the Desk bundle resolve lies inside the
channel-booster package (esbuild's inputs for cli/main.ts and
dashboard/engine.ts), nothing in it imports Grok UI's src/, server/,
scripts/ or bin/, and no line of Grok UI's source beyond an import statement
or a common idiom appears in the booster's code. The Desk
(channel-booster/dashboard/) is a server-free single HTML file of its own:
it uses none of Grok UI's app, server or styles.

What the booster shares with Grok UI is a choice of typefaces, not code: the
Desk sets its type in Syne, IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono, as Grok UI does.

